        "definition": "max(0,3.41*(OGLE E(V-I)/1.318 - 0.06)) divided by the area-weighted HERITAGE A_V in each full published adaptive square. Fractions are restricted to 0.02–0.98 to keep finite depths. Conflicting columns and zero internal reddening remain explicitly counted.",
